{"time": 1770202257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "25895339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1048556042", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以啊，既然横须同学没什么事的话，那走吧，反正我正好也很无聊”"}
